00:02:16.127 --> 00:02:17.879
<v Host>It means to be born.

00:02:18.479 --> 00:02:24.671
<v Slow>ライチョウは、国の特別天然記念物です。

00:02:25.472 --> 00:02:29.479
<v Host>The rock ptarmigan is a national special natural monument.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.063
