00:02:34.463 --> 00:02:40.608
<v Host>It means a special natural monument, a plant or animal specially protected by the country.

00:02:41.207 --> 00:02:46.512
<v Slow>高い山にすむ、めずらしい鳥です。

00:02:47.312 --> 00:02:50.503
<v Host>It is a rare bird that lives in high mountains.

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:53.695
<v Vocab>めずらしい

00:02:54.096 --> 00:02:56.663
<v Host>It means rare or unusual.

00:02:57.264 --> 00:03:05.159
<v Slow>今、数が少なくなっていて、絶滅が心配されています。

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:10.759
<v Host>Right now its numbers are getting smaller, and people worry it may go extinct.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.855
